    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Outline of the case</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383120/extras/\u63a2\u7d22.gif?t=1749909333\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tatsuya Narumi, a man who has lost all memory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wakes up in a strange house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange phenomena occur. Eerie singing voices coming from inside the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relying on the light of his cell phone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He explores the house where strange phenomena occur one after another</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and unravel the hidden mystery...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Investigation Method</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person exploration adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player controls the light using the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > and collect information and items by investigating points of interest, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and collect information and items in order to escape from the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the search, various strange phenomena will occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please enjoy the tension like in a haunted house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Interaction with collaborators</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misaki, a mysterious girl you will meet during your search.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By showing her items, you can enjoy various conversations and hints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy various conversations and hints by showing her the items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's cooperate with each other to escape from the house together.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Outline of the case</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383120/extras/\u63a2\u7d22.gif?t=1749909333\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tatsuya Narumi, a man who has lost all memory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wakes up in a strange house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange phenomena occur. Eerie singing voices coming from inside the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relying on the light of his cell phone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He explores the house where strange phenomena occur one after another</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and unravel the hidden mystery...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Investigation Method</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person exploration adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player controls the light using the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > and collect information and items by investigating points of interest, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and collect information and items in order to escape from the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the search, various strange phenomena will occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please enjoy the tension like in a haunted house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Interaction with collaborators</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misaki, a mysterious girl you will meet during your search.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By showing her items, you can enjoy various conversations and hints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy various conversations and hints by showing her the items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's cooperate with each other to escape from the house together.</p>",
